RabbitMQ 软件的主机配置
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
RabbitMQ 软件受主机的内核参数的影响, 这些内核参数登记在下述配置文件:

    •  资源限制文件 /etc/security/limits.conf
    •  资源限制文件 /etc/security/limits.d/20-nproc.conf (优先级高于 /etc/security/limits.conf 资源限制文件)
    •  内核参数文件 /etc/sysctl.conf
    •  启动参数文件 /etc/default/grub (永久关闭透明大页的启动参数 transparent_hugepage=never)

资源限制文件 /etc/security/limits.conf
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*  -  nproc   65535
*  -  nofile  65535
*  -  core    unlimited
*  -  fsize   unlimited
*  -  rss     unlimited
*  -  stack   unlimited
*  -  memlock unlimited
*  -  as      unlimited

内核参数文件 /etc/sysctl.conf
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
fs.file-max = 65535
vm.overcommit_memory = 1
vm.swappiness = 1
vm.zone_reclaim_mode = 0
net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse = 1
net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_time = 600
net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout = 30
net.ipv4.tcp_max_tw_buckets = 5000
net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies = 1
net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog = 4096
net.ipv4.tcp_rmem = 4096 32768 262142
net.ipv4.tcp_wmem = 4096 32768 262142
net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range = 1024 65535
net.core.netdev_max_backlog = 8096
net.core.rmem_default = 262144
net.core.wmem_default = 262144
net.core.rmem_max = 2097152
net.core.wmem_max = 2097152

""""""""" 演示资源调优的基本步骤
[root ~]# cat > /etc/security/limits.conf << EOF
*  -  nproc   65535
*  -  nofile  65535
*  -  core    unlimited
*  -  fsize   unlimited
*  -  rss     unlimited
*  -  stack   unlimited
*  -  memlock unlimited
*  -  as      unlimited
EOF
[root ~]# ulimit -a
